# SLA Tooltips
sla-tooltip-approval = Share of requests where Approval SLA Status is Breached. Formula: breached approval rows / evaluable approval rows. Rows with missing approval timeline are excluded.
sla-tooltip-payout = Share of requests where Payout SLA Status is Breached. Payout SLA limit is dynamic per request: min(next or same Monday after approval, remaining total SLA window = total SLA - approval days).
sla-tooltip-total-breached = Share of requests where Total Cycle SLA Status is Breached. Formula: breached total-cycle rows / evaluable total-cycle rows. Total cycle compares pending-to-paid duration against total SLA limit.
sla-tooltip-total-within = Share of requests where Total Cycle SLA Status is Within SLA. Formula: within-SLA total-cycle rows / evaluable total-cycle rows.
